  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance equitable access and improve quality education for all children including girls and children with disabilities (CwD).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen education data management system, analysis, and use of data in policy and programme decision making in primary education; engage community to improve girls&#x2019; retention and completion of education in primary and secondary; and mainstream gender and inclusion in the curriculum, textbooks, and teacher training programmes, and learning assessment at primary and secondary level.</narrative>
  </description>
